# UI/UX Design — ui-ux-pro-max

For any UI/UX design, layout, styling, or visual review work in this project:

1. **Read the skill first:** `~/.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`
2. **Generate a design system** before implementing:
   ```bash
   python3 ~/.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<product> <industry> <keywords>" --design-system -p "AI Atlas"
   ```
3. **Follow stack guidelines** for Next.js + Tailwind:
   ```bash
   python3 ~/.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<topic>" --stack nextjs
   ```
4. **Persist design tokens** when building multiple pages (`--persist` flag).
5. Run pre-delivery checklist from the skill before finishing.

Source: https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
